# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DOMISLINK DOMAIN PARKING - APACHE .HTACCESS
# All domains redirect to https://domislink.com
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RewriteEngine On

# Force HTTPS
RewriteCond %{HTTPS} off
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://%{HTTP_HOST}%{REQUEST_URI} [L,R=301]

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PRIMARY BRAND DOMAINS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?domislink\.ng$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?domislink\.io$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?domislink\.ai$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?domis\.link$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?getdomislink\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# HOSTING DOMAINS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?domishost\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?domiscloud\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?hostdomis\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?aihost\.ng$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CMS DOMAINS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?domiscms\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?domisbuilder\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?buildwithdomis\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NIGERIAN MARKET DOMAINS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?domislink\.com\.ng$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?nairahost\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?hostnaija\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CREATIVE/BRANDING DOMAINS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?zeroeffort\.host$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?autopilothost\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?aiwebhost\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?hostmars\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?mars\.host$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?tomars\.io$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?directstack\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^(www\.)?99ai\.host$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# WWW TO NON-WWW (Main Domain)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

RewriteCond %{HTTP_HOST} ^www\.domislink\.com$ [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://domislink.com/$1 [L,R=301]

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SECURITY HEADERS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header always set X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
    Header always set X-Frame-Options "DENY"
    Header always set X-XSS-Protection "1; mode=block"
    Header always set Referrer-Policy "strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
</IfModule>
